{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nova: First Spark</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a young star-like creature exploring the bright and barren expanses of space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect shards by completing objectives to propel yourself through the cosmos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Gameplay</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Navigate through 30 platforming levels, each with specific objectives to progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use asteroids as platforms to jump from one point to another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some asteroids have unique behaviors that affect gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize movement mechanics such as bouncing and dashing to traverse levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Perform combos using movement mechanics to earn more points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Additional Features</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Levels can be replayed to achieve higher scores or faster completion times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes arcade modes where the player must jump from asteroid to asteroid to stay on screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade modes feature multiplayer capabilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638870?t=1772126412","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3638870?t=1772126412","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638870/cc85e75cf6700b4f394ee279527ba4e832cb98d4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772126412","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3638870/cc85e75cf6700b4f394ee279527ba4e832cb98d4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772126412","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"descripti